    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trip Japan Puzzle</strong> is a screw-removal puzzle game set in Japan\u2019s most famous locations! Solve puzzles while enjoying beautiful stage backgrounds featuring Tokyo, Kyoto, Osaka, Mount Fuji, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Simple Yet Deep Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Remove screws from wooden parts and rearrange them to clear each stage!<br>\ud83d\uddfe <strong>Feel Like You're Traveling in Japan</strong> \u2013 Visit iconic locations like Asakusa, Todaiji, Itsukushima Shrine, and Glover Garden while solving puzzles!<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stunning Visuals</strong> \u2013 Enjoy realistic backgrounds featuring actual photos, combined with the warm aesthetics of wooden puzzles.<br>\ud83d\udd79 <strong>Intuitive Controls</strong> \u2013 Easy to play with mouse or touch controls! Perfect for both beginners and puzzle enthusiasts.<br>\u23f3 <strong>Play at Your Own Pace</strong> \u2013 Gradually increasing difficulty ensures a satisfying and rewarding puzzle experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Japan\u2019s famous sites while enjoying a fun and brain-teasing puzzle adventure!<br>Can you solve all the challenges and clear every stage?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trip Japan Puzzle</strong> is a screw-removal puzzle game set in Japan\u2019s most famous locations! Solve puzzles while enjoying beautiful stage backgrounds featuring Tokyo, Kyoto, Osaka, Mount Fuji, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Simple Yet Deep Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Remove screws from wooden parts and rearrange them to clear each stage!<br>\ud83d\uddfe <strong>Feel Like You're Traveling in Japan</strong> \u2013 Visit iconic locations like Asakusa, Todaiji, Itsukushima Shrine, and Glover Garden while solving puzzles!<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stunning Visuals</strong> \u2013 Enjoy realistic backgrounds featuring actual photos, combined with the warm aesthetics of wooden puzzles.<br>\ud83d\udd79 <strong>Intuitive Controls</strong> \u2013 Easy to play with mouse or touch controls! Perfect for both beginners and puzzle enthusiasts.<br>\u23f3 <strong>Play at Your Own Pace</strong> \u2013 Gradually increasing difficulty ensures a satisfying and rewarding puzzle experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Japan\u2019s famous sites while enjoying a fun and brain-teasing puzzle adventure!<br>Can you solve all the challenges and clear every stage?</p>",
